Bind Npc 29014 Zone 71 for karus
Bind Npc 29027 Zone 71 for elmorad
Quest 713 "[Lemegeton] The Third Underworld"
    Journal for karus "You must join the devil war with [Order of the Sorcery] Bros."
    Journal for elmorad "You must join the devil war with [Order of the Sorcery] Sais."
    Collect 1 of 900231000
    Collect 1 of 900232000

Requires (player level >= 71 and player is karus and quest 711 is completed) or (player level >= 71 and player is elmorad and quest 712 is completed)

Rewards
    Give 250000 experience
    Give 30000 coins

On available
    Say "Phew, it was a tough fight. Let's go to Bros of [Order of the Sorcery]"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "You are here. Your last work was great."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Please give me the seal Scroll that you will seal in your body, then, <selfname>.\n\nWe must give Bros of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land the seal Scrolls for [22Devil] Ipos and [46Devil] Bifrons."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "You are here. Your last work was great."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Please give me the seal Scroll that you will seal in your body, then, <selfname>.\n\nWe must give Sais of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land the seal Scrolls for [22Devil] Ipos and [46Devil] Bifrons."

On in_progress
    Say "Where is the seal Scroll?"

On claimable
    Show quest "Thank you. With this seal Scroll, the soul of devil will be locked in this ring."

On completed
    Say "[Devil 34] Furfur has very strong and dreadful power, and he rules storms and thunderbolts. According to a story, the [Devil 34] Furfur has destroyed a castle only by his power. Destroy [Devil 58] Amy and [Devil 71] Dantalion with [Devil 34] Furfur. It'll be helpful if you remove the devils that can be strong forces for the devil army."
